{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_title", "source_sha256": "b985155cdcf5a8379c8c63a428fb0ac287b9824c9d5cd0fcc0a01d078878a524", "ja": "星たちのトライアングル", "zh": "群星的大三角", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "af054f0c080a77753b043a91145076df10c4ce91fc8d8d36916c1db73037d3ae", "ja": "ドラマのムック本発売を記念して、サイン会\nを行った『STAR ELEMENTS』。ファン\nの反応を思い出して喜ぶ未来、可奈、琴葉。\n3人はドラマの続編を勝手に予想し、\nあれこれおしゃべりするのだった。", "zh": "为纪念电视剧特刊发售，『STAR ELEMENTS』举办了签名会。粉丝们的反应令未来、可奈和琴叶回想起来就很开心。\n3人擅自猜测着电视剧的续篇，聊个不停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "b3c5eb997c127362458d1b5abb71500c35a68dbaa037c6147af4bc478fbde030", "ja": "ムック本のサイン会～♪　大満足で、おしまい～♪\nみんなが喜んでくれて、本当に良かったです！", "zh": "设定集签售会～♪　超级满足，结束啦～♪\n大家能开心，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "03e6f0ef7961c47b58a58744fa766a1e8d3abc645c39bee3522b2d3e7d49f563", "ja": "お客さん、いっぱい来てくれたね！　私、お客さんに\n「本物の光駆ちゃんだ～！」って言われちゃった♪", "zh": "来了好多客人呢！我还被客人说：“是真正的光駆——！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "537e51fd8016c3a94112580a4093c36d13152e6cdef7bf87cf6608309596804a", "ja": "私は、小さい子に「水桜ちゃんだ……！」って、\nビックリした顔で指さされちゃった。琴葉さんは？", "zh": "我被小孩子指着，一脸惊讶地说：“是水樱姐姐……！”琴叶你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0e64624c1196ca1b3591da6e1360e2e2bd1f2561fc3777e4f85c6e3c2508d018", "ja": "私も、普段は「琴葉ちゃん」って呼ばれるけど、\n今日は「星蘭さん」が多かったかも。", "zh": "我平时也会被叫作“小琴叶”，不过今天好像更多人叫我“星兰小姐”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "acdbfc5634009643b5c10073774edf777941459a5549d4ac2b6de8b899291b66", "ja": "ドラマの役名で呼ばれるのって、\nなんだか照れくさいけど、うれしいですね！", "zh": "被人用电视剧里的角色名来称呼，总觉得有点害羞，但也很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "6aa829852ad962961815fff4df079e0c8cb36fbd78d4c056e53bf593b18fe903", "ja": "可奈の名前は矢吹可奈～♪\nドラマの中は神崎水桜～♪　えへ♪", "zh": "可奈的名字是矢吹可奈～♪\n电视剧里是神崎水樱～♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "049d3b8b4c3892e9b47876398c47234920af0ae69067a0b2d46fd912142aa66b", "ja": "もらったお手紙にも、「光駆ちゃん大好き！」って\nいっぱい書いてあったよ！　なんか新鮮～。", "zh": "收到的信上也写满了“最喜欢光驱！”呢！感觉还挺新鲜的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "5197801047293c5cbad181ab29ff6b987e8d230751b979d98881b0b2b1923edf", "ja": "私、「水桜ちゃん、がんばって」ってお手紙を\nもらって……なんか、泣きそうになっちゃいました。", "zh": "我收到了写着\"水樱加油\"的信……\n不知为何，差点哭出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "b08236e0329790e8f96705066a5a1398fc079f9f243464815a7053185dcca67a", "ja": "うん。それだけお客さんは、真剣に\nドラマを見てくれたってことなんだろうね。", "zh": "嗯。也就是说，客人们都很认真地看了这部电视剧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "46be8f80b9b9a4a67979f13c6c1a7ff5e069bf6942ddc256259a70c5acecd862", "ja": "私たちのドラマ……『階のスターエレメンツ』を、\n本当に楽しんでくれたんだなって。", "zh": "大家真的很享受我们的剧……《阶之星元素》呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "24f07af9177e95f8e5c29d788826fe8b1b70830d13c489c51a3401a47b33fd5b", "ja": "私がやった水桜は、けっこうイジワルな役だったから。\n嫌われてるかな？って思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "我演的水樱是个挺坏心眼的角色，所以我还在想，会不会被讨厌呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "de8824c7aad55e32dd1f295de3ce306f9872e4430973cd0ff193d8837cfb18fa", "ja": "でも全然、そんなことありませんでした！\n水桜のこと好きになってもらえて、うれしかったな～。", "zh": "不过完全不是那么回事！\n能让大家喜欢上水樱，我真的很开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "a91366f8806c111822c9754201c025f1c0f459475d95e4342373f0da6e02ac50", "ja": "二面性がある役って、すごく難しいものね。\nでも可奈ちゃんのお芝居、素敵だったと思う。", "zh": "有双重性格的角色，真的很难演呢。\n不过，我觉得可奈的演技很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "cfb8d94c046f6e877c6698b61b692979103a7d96560e472678c09982ab63874b", "ja": "琴葉さん……えへっ。ありがとうございます！\n難しかったけど、がんばってよかったな～♪", "zh": "琴叶……嘿嘿。谢谢你！\n虽然很难，但努力果然是值得的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "47cfd2985a1ab3599716e9ce5d148276f302c988430d17f4605ec76523bbcd18", "ja": "え～？　可奈ばっかりほめられて、ずるい～！\n琴葉ちゃん、私は？　私のお芝居はどうだった？", "zh": "诶～？只夸可奈一个人，也太狡猾了～！\n琴叶，我呢？我的演技怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "b984c000957d5dffef39b29ebc888f1d444bc0a52b350eb23e3ce83db1a1c026", "ja": "未来は……練習の時は大変そうだったけど。水桜に\n立ち向かった時の光駆、すごくよかったと思うな。", "zh": "未来……排练的时候看起来挺辛苦的。不过，面对水桜时的光駆，我觉得真的演得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "698d3f4617493f6e0f7ad63cfbafbd48c25c33ff3fd2261e54819ea790ec62fd", "ja": "目の前で起きていることに、戸惑って、怒って、\n傷ついて。でも、諦めないって気持ちを叫んで。", "zh": "因眼前发生的一切而困惑、愤怒，也受到伤害。但是，她喊出了绝不放弃的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "ec8786dd383b6123348ea33a25cd607c306c0336131e30ee5336ae1fee9e510e", "ja": "未来と似たところもあるけど、それだけじゃなくて……\n「そこに天羽光駆がいる」って、感じられたかも。", "zh": "虽然也有和未来相似的地方，但不只是这样……\n或许，我感受到了“天羽光駆就在那儿”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "b8a7b5781d1aedb0622babc7c8dc4e4ced5b45a3189905e88375808c0e9377b3", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん……ありがとうっ！\nうれしいな～、えへへへ……♪", "zh": "琴叶……谢谢你！\n好开心呀～嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "829d96c8b26abcd5323a77e1841d287d571177b6520b2868101b04b2884caf5a", "ja": "でも私がお芝居できたのは、琴葉ちゃんが教えてくれた\nからだし！　やっぱり、琴葉ちゃんが一番すごかった！", "zh": "不过我能演好这出戏，也是因为琴叶教了我嘛！果然还是琴叶最厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "2861b23f3e585275d7c2ee88974880fa0a84d254b914bb49f8edadd3668ee318", "ja": "うん！　琴葉さんが私と未来ちゃんの面倒を\nみてくれたから、すっごく良くなったんだと思うっ！", "zh": "嗯！都是因为琴叶姐照顾了我和未来，所以我觉得才能进步这么多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "64fbac061fdaeff1357f33281d7c1783a9e072d32e2c36ab2548ae9e15a7a947", "ja": "そんなことないと思うけど……それに、\nドラマが好評だったのは、全員でがんばった結果だよ。", "zh": "我觉得没那回事……而且，电视剧能受到好评，也是大家一起努力的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "007a0fd98af1f387e2299722ac19ce1850a271ccad48926b9191de517c7436b5", "ja": "ドラマの撮影、難しかったけど、楽しかったな～。\nまたお仕事、できるといいな～♪", "zh": "电视剧的拍摄虽然很难，但很开心呢～  \n要是还能再一起工作就好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb65ae3eca364c8be6cf45ca11d08c5dba40b9808e9dd532bd35f2c2d8f6f5d3", "ja": "そういえば、今日もらったお手紙に書いてあったんだ！\n「ドラマの続編はないんですか？」って。", "zh": "对了，今天收到的信里还写着呢！\n“电视剧没有续集吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "1c61381c32195e12e9bfd5c8bf813d4fbd7722680940c7a8ec1329e7dbdbf832", "ja": "続編かぁ……。もしこのお話が続くとしたら、\nふたりはどんな展開が見てみたい？", "zh": "续集啊……要是这个故事还会继续的话，你们两个想看看怎样的发展？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "dbcc791b3254c464883ba39460dec57ecc11df8b0b0302668d3b99e169425186", "ja": "お話が続くとしたら……あ、わかった！　私、水桜が\nふたりと本当に仲良くなれたら、うれしいかも！？", "zh": "如果故事继续的话……啊，我知道了！要是水樱能和那两个人真正成为好朋友，我可能会很开心！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "db8066592f51b7d6016d5327e6dfeb6c3c3348fb04685d74a39ce22c55572ec4", "ja": "水桜ちゃんと仲良くなるの、簡単だよ。\n水桜ちゃんが、イジワルしなければいいんだもん！", "zh": "和水樱成为好朋友，很简单哦。只要水樱不使坏就好了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6c2e95bad2cbf5a090d10a721f413583737137ec953bd7acf2ad4f1ae5b5a6b", "ja": "え～！\nそれはそうだけど、そうじゃないんだってば～！", "zh": "诶～！\n虽然是这样，但不是这个意思啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "ce9b0c478232f7a6587b7d1db8aa013c9dd7c1a2ee3c8fe9ae6317daef010c5a", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。水桜がイジワルするのには、\n本人なりの理由があるみたいだし……。", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。水樱之所以要捉弄人，似乎也有她自己的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_012_se_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_012_se_01_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "552ee3a2acc250629e9475d9160cf7f3d949b6a93ebfa9142f0c02564d96bde0", "ja": "じゃあ、琴葉ちゃんは？\n続編やるなら、どんなお話がいい？", "zh": "那琴叶呢？\n如果要拍续集，你想要什么样的故事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
